hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2812","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Yahya, narrated to us Abdullah ibn Muhammad al-Nufayli, narrated to us Hatim ibn Isma'il, narrated to us Ja'far, on the authority of his father, who said:\nWe entered upon Jabir ibn 'Abdullah, and he mentioned the hadith and said:\n\Then he (the Prophet ﷺ) delivered a sermon"","" then Bilal called the iqamah"","" then he prayed Zuhr. Then he called the iqamah again and prayed 'Asr. He did not pray anything between them. Then he mounted al-Qaswa' (his she-camel) until he reached al-Mawqif (the standing place at 'Arafah).\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
